# No sandbox dispatch

Command MUST NOT run OpenClaw reachability probes, `control-pack` / `poc-dispatch` /
`dispatch-send`, or any Control/Implementation delegation from a **Cursor sandbox**
shell (default sandbox / limited network).

Sandbox loopback cannot reach the host gateway (commonly `127.0.0.1:18789`), which
falsely reports `runtime_unavailable` and wrongly selects `in-host`.

Required:

- Host-network (or `required_permissions: ["all"]`) for gateway health, sessions,
  pack build that chooses `provider`, and every `dispatch-send` / role spawn.
- If a probe only ran under sandbox and said unreachable, re-probe outside sandbox
  before accepting fallback `in-host`.
- Do not treat sandbox `ECONNREFUSED` on OpenClaw as proof the gateway is down.

See [[META-017]].
